  "kind": "DATA_FOUNDATION_SNAPSHOT_FREEZE",
  "knownLimitations": [
    "Validation covers only the fixed 60-fact fiscal-2015 original-XBRL sample (v3 PASS, concept identity, not statement-membership proof). The 8,826 canonical-v2 records rest on the element/label rules and were not source-validated by that audit.",
    "250 of 260 PIT-universe tickers have at least one record; 6 preferred-share tickers are unresolved identities (no corpCode) and 4 further resolved issuers have no record.",
    "The raw-statement collection reported datasetComplete=false with 521 unsettled items and 2,604 recorded source absences (013) at the source commit.",
    "DART serves statements from 2015; fiscal-2015 quarterlies exist only through original XBRL, so 2016 growth features stay structurally unavailable (audited in kr-accounting-coverage-repair-v1).",
    "2,639 records carry an amendment's later availableFrom; earlier original values are not in the snapshot and restatement history is not modelled.",
    "400 records lack at least one of the four families; 2 records fail the receipt-date test and are never visible.",
    "fiscalYear 2026 is partial (availableFrom up to 2026-09-16).",
    "Consolidated and separate bases are recorded, not harmonised.",
    "This freezes an input, not a study: no Alpha, outcome or label was read, and no Alpha-v5 design is implied."
  ],
  "notThis": [
    "Alpha research or an Alpha-v5 preregistration",
    "an accounting repair, refetch, reselection or tuning",
    "a rerun of any validation"
  ],
